# L §5.9 Rows replaced: "A version ... whose `replace` rows do neither [match the earlier table's intervals, nor form
# a whole table] is refused (LOAD-BAND)".  (20, 30] and (40, inf) match no interval of v1's table and leave a gap.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2027-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2027-12-31

source s "s"
band b(n: int): int

version v1
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2025-12-01
  b: [0, 10] = 1
  b: (10, inf) = 2

version v2
  cite s
  governs 2027..
  known 2026-12-01
  replace b: (20, 30] = 3
  replace b: (40, inf) = 4
=== expect
refused: LOAD-BAND ...
